WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:04.559
With shadowing and lighting now wrapped up,

2
00:00:04.559 --> 00:00:08.699
we have finished our Groom introduction.

3
00:00:08.699 --> 00:00:12.699
We first started this course by taking a look at what Groom was and

4
00:00:12.699 --> 00:00:17.260
how you can use it to achieve some very lifelike-looking hair

5
00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:22.219
and fur and whatever real-time project you're using on RealEngine 5.

6
00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:25.260
We then looked at how we enable the Groom plugin.

7
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.199
We imported some Groom assets.

8
00:00:27.199 --> 00:00:30.160
We explored the various Groom tool settings.

9
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.560
We then looked at how to create a very simple Groom material

10
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.659
using the Material Editor and the Hair Attribute node.

11
00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:40.159
We then looked at how we can apply Grooms to assets in both our levels and

12
00:00:40.159 --> 00:00:44.659
Blueprints and followed that up with Groom shadowing and lighting,

13
00:00:44.659 --> 00:00:46.859
and how the various settings will affect

14
00:00:46.859 --> 00:00:49.259
the shadowing and lighting of our Groom assets.

15
00:00:49.259 --> 00:00:51.560
It was my pleasure having you in class today,

16
00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.359
and I look forward to seeing you next time.

17
00:00:53.359 --> 00:00:55.359
Thank you.
